"Seals unlock wizardry; the making of mana and of wizardry form one cycle."
"Seals are built of mana, wizardry and a third, deeper force beyond wizardry."
"Kaelis told Nathan to leave the deeper magic beyond wizardry alone."
"Later, Stella burns Litcliff's palace with her first wizardry."
"Later, Stella finds wizardry easiest with flame; her wizard flame is dark purple."
"Ushia calls Stella's purple wizard flame the flame of ambition."
"Later, Stella learns wizardry from Ushia, and says it is like writing with her other hand."
"Later, Stella reads a book on wizardry and a Kalis wizard's journal from a looted vault."
"Later, Nathan learns wizardry from watching a fire elemental that tried to burn him."
"Later, Badud stacks enhancements on his own mana pool."
"Later, Nathan strips Badud's wizardry, stopping him casting big wizardry for a long time."
"Later, Stella's triple crystallized shields and wizardry-infused spells act half on their own."
"Years later, Stella does wizardry research for the council of Davrar."
